Description: Download and load Quebec Election Study ('QES') datasets from
    Dataverse repositories through a simple survey-code interface. Studies
    are cataloged by the Centre for the Study of Democratic Citizenship
    <https://csdc-cecd.ca/portail-quebecois-sur-lopinion-publique/>.
